(7560803, 1211877, 179769, '<td valign="top">But, if "frog" is the subject, the only real part that matters is the eyes.  So, wouldn''t a frog rear-end better meet the challenge?   I''m so confused!  I still give 6 because I love it.</td>', 'But, if "frog" is the subject, the only real part that matters is the eyes.  So, wouldn''t a frog rear-end better meet the challenge?   I''m so confused!  I still give 6 because I love it.', '2018-02-25 15:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
