(7560812, 1212008, 173844, '<td valign="top">First of all, this is beautiful.  The reflected blues of the sky, the light blue and light purple clouds and the orange-gold dog offer a glimpse of an alternate world akin to our own but forever out of reach.  It looks terrific upside down too.  Very enjoyable, as in bringing joy.</td>', 'First of all, this is beautiful.  The reflected blues of the sky, the light blue and light purple clouds and the orange-gold dog offer a glimpse of an alternate world akin to our own but forever out of reach.  It looks terrific upside down too.  Very enjoyable, as in bringing joy.', '2018-02-25 16:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
