(7560873, 1211990, 50695, '<td valign="top">Looks like pennystreet because the exposure is perfect. In this case it creates bold brilliant blacks as well as the highlights<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Looks like pennystreet because the exposure is perfect. In this case it creates bold brilliant blacks as well as the highlights ', '2018-02-25 23:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560874, 1212007, 173844, '<td valign="top">Either a beheading or whack-a-mole, this noir image is serious stuff.  In addition to the dramatic shadows, I like the precision of the floor, walls and ceiling.</td>', 'Either a beheading or whack-a-mole, this noir image is serious stuff.  In addition to the dramatic shadows, I like the precision of the floor, walls and ceiling.', '2018-02-25 23:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560875, 1212015, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting way to indicate a presence outside of the frame --  let the smoke of the incense lead you there.</td>', 'Interesting way to indicate a presence outside of the frame --  let the smoke of the incense lead you there.', '2018-02-25 23:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560876, 1211848, 173844, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see an indication of an actual canoeist in the image, otherwise I''m not comfortable taking it on spec.  The sun and cloud formations are quite cinematic.</td>', 'I''d like to see an indication of an actual canoeist in the image, otherwise I''m not comfortable taking it on spec.  The sun and cloud formations are quite cinematic.', '2018-02-25 23:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560877, 1211993, 173844, '<td valign="top">This is too minimal for me to catch hold of.  Perhaps it''s a depiction of stark terror, in which case it''s more meaty.</td>', 'This is too minimal for me to catch hold of.  Perhaps it''s a depiction of stark terror, in which case it''s more meaty.', '2018-02-25 23:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560878, 1212012, 173844, '<td valign="top">That''s a huge missing presence.  Reminds me of the magicians who make elephants and airliners disappear with the whisk of a curtain.  It''s pretty in any case, and I''m going to take your word on the rest of the craft.</td>', 'That''s a huge missing presence.  Reminds me of the magicians who make elephants and airliners disappear with the whisk of a curtain.  It''s pretty in any case, and I''m going to take your word on the rest of the craft.', '2018-02-25 23:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560879, 1211877, 173844, '<td valign="top">I''m going to guess brontosaurus.  Comical and graphically abrupt.</td>', 'I''m going to guess brontosaurus.  Comical and graphically abrupt.', '2018-02-25 23:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560880, 1211991, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like how the missing presence can be inferred by the billow of the parachute.  I''m curious about your vantage point.</td>', 'I like how the missing presence can be inferred by the billow of the parachute.  I''m curious about your vantage point.', '2018-02-25 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560882, 1211944, 173844, '<td valign="top">Perhaps this would be stronger within the challenge if you truncated their trunks.  But maybe I''ve missed the point and you''re highlighting the parked scooters.  Everyone''s in such a hurry these days.</td>', 'Perhaps this would be stronger within the challenge if you truncated their trunks.  But maybe I''ve missed the point and you''re highlighting the parked scooters.  Everyone''s in such a hurry these days.', '2018-02-25 23:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560883, 1211614, 173844, '<td valign="top">I think I see the wisp of a person on the far left.</td>', 'I think I see the wisp of a person on the far left.', '2018-02-25 23:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560884, 1211515, 173844, '<td valign="top">Cute.</td>', 'Cute.', '2018-02-25 23:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560886, 1212016, 173844, '<td valign="top">But note the archaeopteryx sweeping down in the upper left!</td>', 'But note the archaeopteryx sweeping down in the upper left!', '2018-02-25 23:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560888, 1211807, 173844, '<td valign="top">Perhaps what''s missing here is beef in the chili dogs.</td>', 'Perhaps what''s missing here is beef in the chili dogs.', '2018-02-25 23:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560889, 1211961, 173844, '<td valign="top">A wonderful snippet, the man rapidly passing through the corner.  There''s a jaw jutted out in determination, almost a sense of not wanting to be there.  The composition is fine, the angled man before the tracery of winter trees, the background clouds filling the image out, and then the marvelous upper bird.  This small but perfectly silhouetted bird yanks the image into balance.  In doing so, it''s as if they''ve formed a momentary esthetic alliance, unbeknownst to them as it is.  On first glance I''d say the mood is somber, but it needn''t be so at all.  Very engaging and evocative.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'A wonderful snippet, the man rapidly passing through the corner.  There''s a jaw jutted out in determination, almost a sense of not wanting to be there.  The composition is fine, the angled man before the tracery of winter trees, the background clouds filling the image out, and then the marvelous upper bird.  This small but perfectly silhouetted bird yanks the image into balance.  In doing so, it''s as if they''ve formed a momentary esthetic alliance, unbeknownst to them as it is.  On first glance I''d say the mood is somber, but it needn''t be so at all.  Very engaging and evocative.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2018-02-25 23:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560890, 1211990, 173844, '<td valign="top">At first I didn''t know what to make of this, but the longer I looked at it the more I appreciated its fleeting delicacy.  The people seem to not be wholly there, as the title expresses, drifting out of reality into reflections and brightness.  The oncoming pedestrians are like bokeh.  All in all a tantalizing and artistic image.<br/>Second favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'At first I didn''t know what to make of this, but the longer I looked at it the more I appreciated its fleeting delicacy.  The people seem to not be wholly there, as the title expresses, drifting out of reality into reflections and brightness.  The oncoming pedestrians are like bokeh.  All in all a tantalizing and artistic image.Second favorite of the challenge.', '2018-02-25 23:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560892, 1212011, 173844, '<td valign="top">Perfect.  Exactly expresses the challenge.  The person the dog is waiting for (assuming it''s not the UPS truck or a cute poodle) is somewhere out there, wending his or her way home, hopefully soon.  Lovely light, a harmonious and serene color palette and the reflected view into the house''s interior complete this gentle, pleasing image.</td>', 'Perfect.  Exactly expresses the challenge.  The person the dog is waiting for (assuming it''s not the UPS truck or a cute poodle) is somewhere out there, wending his or her way home, hopefully soon.  Lovely light, a harmonious and serene color palette and the reflected view into the house''s interior complete this gentle, pleasing image.', '2018-02-25 23:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560893, 1211961, 100831, '<td valign="top">A moment of beauty.</td>', 'A moment of beauty.', '2018-02-25 23:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560894, 1212000, 173844, '<td valign="top">If the challenge was merely "Lines" this would be a winning entry.  Just add someone entering the subway and the image does just as well for this current challenge.  The nicely chosen perspective adds drama to the scene, and the angled, gleaming leading lines provide a compelling inner structure.  What seems ordinary to the average New Yorker is given a gloss of adventure.</td>', 'If the challenge was merely "Lines" this would be a winning entry.  Just add someone entering the subway and the image does just as well for this current challenge.  The nicely chosen perspective adds drama to the scene, and the angled, gleaming leading lines provide a compelling inner structure.  What seems ordinary to the average New Yorker is given a gloss of adventure.', '2018-02-25 23:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560895, 1212009, 173844, '<td valign="top">I feel two ways about this image.  The capture of the still life is beautiful, the tones nuanced and creamy.  The scene itself, in my opinion, is less compelling.  Perhaps I''m being over-rational, but the peppers seem arbitrary.  Maybe I just don''t understand the genre.  Aside from that I like it.</td>', 'I feel two ways about this image.  The capture of the still life is beautiful, the tones nuanced and creamy.  The scene itself, in my opinion, is less compelling.  Perhaps I''m being over-rational, but the peppers seem arbitrary.  Maybe I just don''t understand the genre.  Aside from that I like it.', '2018-02-25 23:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560896, 1212017, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like how straightforward this is.  Looking up into a mirror, and now the ceiling is happily disposed in half and in quarters, a pleasing composition, with honest textures and a spray of vegetation.  There are so many ways this wouldn''t work --  this isn''t one of them.</td>', 'I like how straightforward this is.  Looking up into a mirror, and now the ceiling is happily disposed in half and in quarters, a pleasing composition, with honest textures and a spray of vegetation.  There are so many ways this wouldn''t work --  this isn''t one of them.', '2018-02-25 23:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560897, 1212011, 100831, '<td valign="top">A special kind, calm moment. Love the processing.</td>', 'A special kind, calm moment. Love the processing.', '2018-02-25 23:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560898, 1212006, 173844, '<td valign="top">Here we are with the traces of automotive choreography, a wintry ballet.  Car and driver are gone, but the memory lingers on, to paraphrase some song out there.  The snow reveals the surprising elegance of simple maneuvers, and it''s kind of poignant.  I''m glad you pointed it out.</td>', 'Here we are with the traces of automotive choreography, a wintry ballet.  Car and driver are gone, but the memory lingers on, to paraphrase some song out there.  The snow reveals the surprising elegance of simple maneuvers, and it''s kind of poignant.  I''m glad you pointed it out.', '2018-02-25 23:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560899, 1211940, 100831, '<td valign="top">This makes me smile.  Thanks for that.</td>', 'This makes me smile.  Thanks for that.', '2018-02-25 23:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560900, 1211919, 173844, '<td valign="top">This emphatically says, "I''m gone."  Nice ghosting.  The other boot could be sharper.</td>', 'This emphatically says, "I''m gone."  Nice ghosting.  The other boot could be sharper.', '2018-02-25 23:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560901, 1211982, 173844, '<td valign="top">Bright and fresh, it''s also appealingly comical.  Additionally, the clouds where the shoulders and face would be are suggestive of the real things.  Which certainly adds a pleasing twist.</td>', 'Bright and fresh, it''s also appealingly comical.  Additionally, the clouds where the shoulders and face would be are suggestive of the real things.  Which certainly adds a pleasing twist.', '2018-02-25 23:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560902, 1212004, 173844, '<td valign="top">Not only is the dog''s shadow lovingly placed, the texture of the rock gives his or her head a startling dimensionality.  A charming image.</td>', 'Not only is the dog''s shadow lovingly placed, the texture of the rock gives his or her head a startling dimensionality.  A charming image.', '2018-02-25 23:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560903, 1211767, 173844, '<td valign="top">The animation in his face convinces the viewer that "the object of his attention" is someone special, which gives depth to the situation.</td>', 'The animation in his face convinces the viewer that "the object of his attention" is someone special, which gives depth to the situation.', '2018-02-25 23:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
